# Battle against Registeel (the steel golem): the Regis' tapped code on every beat, never letting up, and a hard
# D-minor theme in driving eighths on a square lead over brass in bare fifths. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Registeel
tempo 170
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.22

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.8 pan=0 rev=0.18
  r1 | o5 a16 a16 a8 e16 e16 e8 a16 a16 a8 o6 c+4 |
  L o5 d8 d8 a8 d8 o6 c8 o5 a8 f8 a8 | o5 g8 f8 e8 f8 d4 a4 | o5 b-8 o6 d8 f8 d8 o5 b-4 f4 | o5 g8 c8 e8 g8 o6 c4 o5 g8 e8 |
